Holodor provenance: OURS (2026-10-19), derived from Qualcomm's upstream SM8750 GPU DT commits
9e39531ce39a ("arm64: dts: qcom: sm8750: Add GPU and GMU nodes", Jie Zhang / Akhil P Oommen)
and c4dc1775c772 ("arm64: dts: qcom: sm8750: Add GPU cooling", Gaurav Kohli / Akhil P Oommen)
plus the Odin 3's stock Android SunP v2 DTB (vendor_boot.img):

1. Fix the GPU OPP ACD control words (`qcom,opp-acd-level`) and DDR interconnect bandwidth
   votes (`opp-peak-kBps`) in `gpu_opp_table`:
   - ROCKNIX's 0038 took the 14 GPU frequencies and `opp-level` (`RPMH_REGULATOR_LEVEL_*`) from
     production Sun v2 (`qcom,gpu-pwrlevels-2`), where 734..1100 MHz sit one voltage rail lower
     than pre-production Sun v1, but accidentally copied `qcom,opp-acd-level` from Sun v1
     (`0x..2b5ffd` at 734..967 MHz, `0x..2a5ffd` at 1050..1100 MHz). Programming higher-rail
     ACD comparator thresholds onto lower-rail corners caused the GMU/ACD adaptive clock divider
     to treat 734..1100 MHz as permanently drooped and divide the GPU clock by 2 (Issue #3).
   - Update all 11 `qcom,opp-acd-level` words and `opp-peak-kBps` votes to Qualcomm's production
     Sun v2 / upstream 9e39531ce39a table (e.g. 734 MHz: `0xa82a5ffd` + 12.4 GB/s; 832..967 MHz:
     `0x882a5ffd` + 16.5..18.6 GB/s; 1050 MHz: `0xa8295ffd` + 18.6 GB/s; 1100 MHz: `0x88295ffd`
     + 18.6 GB/s).
2. Align `gmu` clocks and OPPs with upstream 9e39531ce39a and stock Android:
   - Add `<&gcc GCC_DDRSS_GPU_AXI_CLK>` (`"axi"`) to `gmu`.
   - Drop the non-existent 687.5 MHz (`NOM`) GMU OPP, keeping 500 MHz (`LOW_SVS`) and 650 MHz (`SVS`).
3. Add GPU passive thermal trip points and `cooling-maps` on `gpuss0-thermal`..`gpuss7-thermal`:
   - Bind `gpuss0_alert0`..`gpuss7_alert0` (`type = "passive"`, `95000` mC / 95 C, matching Odin 3
     Android `tj_cfg = 0x17318`, with `polling-delay-passive = <10>`) to
     `< &gpu THERMAL_NO_LIMIT THERMAL_NO_LIMIT >` so devfreq steps down from 1100 MHz before the
     unthrottled GPU can reach >100 C under sustained ALU load.

From: transentient <11418311+transentient@users.noreply.github.com>
